# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Personal data. This repository is public; none of this belongs in it.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Your real resume: contact details, work history, work authorization.
# See resume/master.example.yaml and resume/template.example.tex for the shape.
resume/master.yaml
resume/template.tex

# Generated resumes, the application tracker, and the score cache. These record
# which jobs you applied to and what you scored, which is nobody else's business.
applications/

# Your outreach phrasing. See config/outreach.example.yaml.
config/outreach.yaml

# Unrelated archive that happens to live in resume/.
resume/*.zip

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
